   "hs_email_body_old1": {
    "body": {
     "hs_enable_module_padding": true,
     "html": "<p>If you already have a legally established business as a licensed healthcare provider and a patient base, launching your own <a href=\"https://www.praxerasupplements.com/blog/benefits-of-selling-private-label-supplements\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\" rel=\"noopener\">private label supplement line offers the following benefits</a>:</p>",
